      "created_at": "2024-10-28T14:01:32.178Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Where is this ability in game?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/99ce4b527d0c8184bfe486da95a0df40f706da8f.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/99ce4b527d0c8184bfe486da95a0df40f706da8f\" title=\"\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/99ce4b527d0c8184bfe486da95a0df40f706da8f_2_358x500.jpeg\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"lWD2fCGicE0skLn5AWO83IYCOF9\" width=\"358\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/99ce4b527d0c8184bfe486da95a0df40f706da8f_2_358x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/99ce4b527d0c8184bfe486da95a0df40f706da8f_2_537x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/99ce4b527d0c8184bfe486da95a0df40f706da8f_2_716x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/99ce4b527d0c8184bfe486da95a0df40f706da8f_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">1346×1878 711 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/92c058fc401604bd652fd7c08520b2b62ced7a51.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/92c058fc401604bd652fd7c08520b2b62ced7a51\" title=\"\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/92c058fc401604bd652fd7c08520b2b62ced7a51_2_359x500.jpeg\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"kWdOr9CdlsNAwgwu6grTj2jDPLH\" width=\"359\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/92c058fc401604bd652fd7c08520b2b62ced7a51_2_359x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/92c058fc401604bd652fd7c08520b2b62ced7a51_2_538x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/92c058fc401604bd652fd7c08520b2b62ced7a51_2_718x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/92c058fc401604bd652fd7c08520b2b62ced7a51_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">1348×1876 717 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Seriously, between Creators, Legions, Overlords and a couple of different upgrades there’s nothing that lets us weld a bunch of minions together to make a bigger minion/lieutenant, much less break down again when defeated.  Legion’s got a trick that lets their minions split into two smaller versions sometimes, but it’s nowhere near on par with this vintage nonsense.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>\n<p>Just FYI, Billy had already established that garlic sausages were lethal to vampires (which is what the little wolves are despite appearances) and Cap <strong>still</strong> thought getting swallowed and punching his way out was the best solution here.  Wisdom of Solomon my butt, he must have mispronounced it as “Hazam” that time.  Big Red Showoff!</p>\n<p>Also, that’s probably Simon &amp; Kirby doing their best CC Beck impersonation there, if the style looks weirdly off but also familiar at the same time.</p>",
