      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Where is this ability in game?\n\n![](upload://lWD2fCGicE0skLn5AWO83IYCOF9.jpeg)\n\n![](upload://kWdOr9CdlsNAwgwu6grTj2jDPLH.jpeg)\n\nSeriously, between Creators, Legions, Overlords and a couple of different upgrades there's nothing that lets us weld a bunch of minions together to make a bigger minion/lieutenant, much less break down again when defeated.  Legion's got a trick that lets their minions split into two smaller versions sometimes, but it's nowhere near on par with this vintage nonsense.  :slight_smile: \n\nJust FYI, Billy had already established that garlic sausages were lethal to vampires (which is what the little wolves are despite appearances) and Cap **still** thought getting swallowed and punching his way out was the best solution here.  Wisdom of Solomon my butt, he must have mispronounced it as \"Hazam\" that time.  Big Red Showoff!\n\nAlso, that's probably Simon & Kirby doing their best CC Beck impersonation there, if the style looks weirdly off but also familiar at the same time.",
