      "cooked": "<p>I think that if I was going to have a welding effect, it would be on the minions themselves, rather than on the villain - something like:</p>\n<p><strong>Wolfpire</strong>: D8 Minion.<br>\nFuse: Remove three minions with Fuse to create a D8 “Megawolf” lieutenant or four minions with Fuse to create a D10 “Megawolf” lieutenant.</p>\n<p><strong>Megawolf</strong>: D8 or D10 lieutenant.<br>\nCollapse: When Megawolf fails a damage save, create a D6 Wolfpire minion without Fuse.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2024-10-28T19:09:16.943Z",
      "reply_count": 1,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
